   141	    # remote-tracking ref. `--not --all` was wrong and dangerous (pair-rail R4,
   142	    # S272; cured in the Grok twin first): `--all` includes LOCAL refs — among
   143	    # them refs/heads/<the branch being pushed>, which points at $local_sha
