    38	    "Placeholder lint (core/frontend skills only)",
    39	    "Validate settings.json and YAML catalogs",
    40	    "Shellcheck hooks and scripts (excluding legacy/)",
    41	    "Check tier boundaries (core/frontend must not reference domains)",
    42	    "actionlint",
    43	    "Hook and script executable bits",
    44	]
    45	
    46	# Os três steps que `4f750f0` removeu; reaparecer é regressão da classe
