+#                           control characters                 (rc 0 = unsafe)
+#   _rel_ancestor_link REL  physical — an ancestor component under $TARGET is
+#                           a symlink; `-f`, `rm -f` and `tar` all follow it,
+#                           `! -L` only ever tests the leaf     (rc 0 = linked)
