.claude/plans/PLAN-169/repass-rc1-20260908-NOGO/r2/verdict-rc1-3.txt:8:  Concrete failure: the changed Codex template says the installer copies it to `.git/hooks/pre-push`, but the Codex emission roster contains only `hooks.json`, `ceo.rules`, and `AGENTS.md`. A v1.3.0 repository upgraded with `--harness codex` receives no push backstop; killing or exhausting the Stop gate permits a canonical push despite shipped documentation saying the pre-push gate holds. The state-directory fix in this payload is therefore dead for adopters. Simply delivering the current template is unsafe because its new-branch range uses self-subtracting `--not --all` at `templates/codex/pre-push-review-gate.sh:128-130`, a bypass already fixed in the Grok twin. No signed condition declares this.  
