.claude/plans/PLAN-169/repass-rc1-20260908-NOGO/r11/verdict-rc1-7.txt:7:P2 — FILE:LINE: [mcp-smoke.yml:314](<WT>/.github/workflows/mcp-smoke.yml:314), [mcp-smoke.yml:323](<WT>/.github/workflows/mcp-smoke.yml:323). The workflow claims to assert an intact HMAC chain, but only counts parseable JSON and silently ignores malformed records; broken `prev`/HMAC values therefore pass. Minimal fix: invoke the real chain verifier, or rename and document the step as JSON-readability-only.
